        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A condensed game adaptation of the Blue Reflection Ray's anime included in the Blue Reflection Quartet bundle.\n\nFollow Hiori and Ruka as they explore the Common while re-experiencing their memories on their way to confront a girl trying to recreate the world. New short stories expand on the anime’s story, and a new prologue and epilogue connect this entry to the other works in the series.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Adaptación condensada en videojuego del anime de Blue Reflection Ray, incluida en el paquete Blue Reflection Quartet.\n\nAcompaña a Hiori y Ruka mientras exploran The Common y revivan sus recuerdos en el camino para enfrentarse a una chica que intenta recrear el mundo. Nuevas historias cortas amplían la trama del anime, y un nuevo prólogo y epílogo conectan esta entrega con las demás obras de la serie.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2026",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
